SUMMARY:[Task] Set up the account
DESCRIPTION:☐ Switch @jaxsquares to a Professional account. Category: Spo
 rts & Recreation (not App Page\, which contradicts “no app to download
 ”).\n☐ Upload the profile picture: option 1\, J² (p-profile-picture/0
 1).\n☐ Name field: “JaxSquares · Football Squares”. The name field 
 is searchable.\n☐ Paste the bio and link from Setup. Link = app URL + ?r
 ef=ig.\n☐ Make 4 Highlights: How it works\, Odds\, Game days\, Thanksgiv
 ing. Use story frames as covers.\n☐ Run a real test board with 3 friends
  and screen-record it (B-roll for the founder Reel).\n☐ Save quick repli
 es for “link?”\, “is it free?” and “do I need the app?”.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Task: Set up the account
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
