SUMMARY:[Reel] Seed post: feature rundown
DESCRIPTION:Asset: 07-features.mp4\, 07-features-cover.png\n\nCAPTION:\nFoo
 tball squares\, minus the spreadsheet 🏈\n\nNo app to download. No accou
 nts. Free pools at $0\, or track a buy-in. Cap squares per player. Winners
  called automatically.\n\nWorks for football\, hoops\, baseball\, hockey a
 nd soccer. Link in bio.\n\n#footballsquares #squarespool #officepool #fant
 asyfootball #gamedayparty\n\n• Videos are exported silent. In the Reels 
 editor\, add an upbeat instrumental from Instagram's audio library at low 
 volume.\n• Upload the matching cover image as the Reel cover so the prof
 ile grid stays clean.\n• Boost candidate later: no dollar amounts on scr
 een.
