SUMMARY:[Reel (film it)] Founder Reel: why we built it
DESCRIPTION:Script:\n- 0–2s (on-screen text): “I built a squares app be
 cause our group chat broke.”\n- 2–10s: hold up the old way. Show the w
 hiteboard photo\, the spreadsheet\, the 99+ unread chat.\n- 10–25s: scre
 en-record making a real board\, start to share link (you recorded this in 
 Prep).\n- 25–35s\, to camera: “Free\, no app\, no signup. Numbers draw
  live\, winners light up.”\n- 35–40s\, ask: “What do we build next: 
 Pick'em\, Bracket Battles\, or King of the Hill?”\n\nCAPTION:\nWhy we bu
 ilt JaxSquares 🟩 (and what's next)\n\nOur squares pool lived in a group
  chat\, a blurry whiteboard photo and a spreadsheet nobody could find. So 
 we built the board we wanted: one link\, everyone claims from their phone\
 , numbers draw live\, winners light up.\n\nNext up: Pick'em\, Bracket Batt
 les or King of the Hill? Vote in the comments 👇\n\n#buildinpublic #star
 tup #jacksonville #footballsquares #squarespool\n\n• Film vertical\, nat
 ural light\, captions on (Instagram's auto-captions are fine).
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Reel (film it): Founder Reel: why we built it
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
