  seconds left. The winning square flipped from 9–0 to 5–0 on the very 
 last play. That's squares.\n\nSend this to the most heartbroken squares pl
 ayer you know.\n\n#onthisday #collegefootball #theplay #calbears #football
 squares\n\n• Videos are exported silent. Add a broadcast-style or nostal
 gic instrumental at low volume.\n• Upload the matching cover image as th
